(%.2f, %.2f) caused overflow or underflow.\\n\", base, exponent);\n        return 1;\n    }\n\n    printf(\"Result: %.2f\\n\", result);\n    return 0;\n}\n\n","numLines":75,"startLine":1,"totalLines":75}}}
